# **Repository audit — initial findings**

I reviewed the `main` branch across the rover, weed-detection pipeline, Android planner, firmware, configuration, CAD exports, and documentation.

Not ready for hardware deployment

The biggest concern is that the project currently has **multiple systems that do not agree on how the physical robot is wired or controlled**. There are also software defects that can cause incorrect movement, unreliable laser targeting, and unsafe behavior.

## **1. Critical hardware and safety problems**

| Severity | Finding                                                                                                                                                                                                                | File                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
| -------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| Critical | The configured laser pin is GPIO 25, which the firmware assigns to the left motor's PWM. The firmware itself assigns the laser to GPIO 4.                                                                              | [rover_config.yaml](https://github.com/BayazidHabibSiddikee/Semi-Autonomous-Weeding-Robot/blob/main/Navigation/rover_config.yaml?utm_source=chatgpt.com), [rover_firmware.py](https://github.com/BayazidHabibSiddikee/Semi-Autonomous-Weeding-Robot/blob/main/Navigation/esp32_firmware/rover_firmware.py?utm_source=chatgpt.com) |
